// - If UnconstrainedChunk does NOT stop on "<<" (chunk budget exhausted), FORCE entry via OpenConstrainedSpan.
// - Inside the span, use AdaptiveConstrainedStep for strong parser control.
// - Close immediately when IsCompletePrefix.
// - Alternate: free chunk -> forced constrained span -> free chunk -> forced constrained span...
// - Reserve budget for final close.
