//     If false: we force entry via OpenConstrainedSpan -> same state: insideConstrainedOut := true, currentConstrainedOut := [].
//     parser.IsValidPrefix([]) holds by precondition. Invariant preserved.
//
//   Branch B (inside span, CloseSpanIfComplete):
